---
description: File and media flows must preserve storage abstraction, authorization, tenant isolation and lifecycle safety
globs:
  - "**/*upload*"
  - "**/*media*"
  - "**/*storage*"
  - "config/filesystems.php"
---

For file/media changes:
- validate type and size
- keep untrusted uploads out of executable paths
- authorize private access before signed URL generation
- namespace tenant files
- keep storage provider behind abstraction
- define cleanup/retention
- add failure/idempotency tests for processing jobs
